abstract: >-
  A historically-calibrated simulation of United States banking-sector chief
  executives spanning 1945-2040. A C++ statistical engine drives the simulation
  of bank-CEO careers and decisions against historical calibration, paired with
  an interactive Svelte demo for exploring the simulated trajectories.
